<title>CANADA: RESEARCH ALERT - Philip Environmental.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Philip Environmental.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Paul Knight initiated coverage of Philip Environmental Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- In a report, called company &quot;the key participant in moving industrial companies from the disposal of waste to recycling.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/8 to 14-1/2 in New York Stock Exchange trading.</p>
</text>
